  "queryImages": [],
  "deprecatedReference": false,
  "deprecatedMatches": {},
  "qid": "168",
  "tip": "<p>When a question describes predictable busy windows, think about <i>capacity reservations</i> and whether you can <i>schedule</i> or time bound them. Distinguish compute capacity controls from <i>storage optimizations</i> like partitioning or snapshots, which do not ensure steady performance.</p>",
